blurb = "This depicts a mihashira (\"three pillars\") torii gate, which is a variation of torii gates that has three pillars and looks like three joined torii gates.

While the origins of the mihashira torii are unclear, some claim that they were built by early Japanese Christians to secretly represent the Holy Trinity, as there's little evidence of such gates in Shinto traditions."
